		first component of BDD
		1. Feature File (Test suite)
				a. Collection of test scenario's
				b. Create a test scenario/test cases by using By gherkin langugage.
				c. file must have ending with extension ".feature"
				d. 	Keyword in gherkin (register.feature)
						Feature: represenation of requirement (this file contains behavior of registeration page)
						Scenario: Test Objective
						Given: pre-conditions
						When: steps to follow (test steps)
						And: add mulitple test steps
						Then: to check expected conditions
						Examples:
						Scenario outlines:
		
		2. Second Component of BDD (StepDefinition file) Glue code.
				a. Normal java file
				b. have method which satisfied the steps mentioned in feature file
				c. cucumber method : (Given, When, Then, And)
				d. WebDriver code (Logic) 
				
				
				
