		Tags in cucumber
		1. Tags in cucumber use to execute testcases(scenario's)	
		2. Tags heps to group or filter the scenario
		3. with tags
			a. run single testcases
			b. run multiple testcases
			c. skip multiple/single testcases
		4. Tags defined in feature file only (to see tags impact , testcases should be ran from runner file )
		5. @- special character, @smoke, @sanity, @login, @checkout, @payment
		6. tag conditions defined in runner files.	
			

